SUMMARY:Untamed - Ecstatic Dance Wave w/ Guest DJ Bobcat
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nFriday\, July 31st\nEvening Dan
 ce Wave 7:00 pm \\- 9:00 pm \\| Warmup 7pm \\| Opening Circle 7:30pm\nGues
 t DJ: Stacey Butcher \\| Support Facilitator: Marta Martín\n\nIntention: 
 Untamed\n\nSummer is a season of wild growth. Fields stretch toward the su
 n\, rivers find their own course\, and life flourishes beyond the boundari
 es we try to impose on it. In the same way\, there is a part of each of us
  that longs to move freely \\~ to shake off expectations\, step outside fa
 miliar patterns\, and reconnect with our natural vitality.\n\nThis ecstati
 c dance is an invitation to listen to the untamed wisdom of the body. Thro
 ugh movement\, we'll explore what happens when we loosen our grip on how w
 e think we should be and instead follow the impulses\, rhythms\, and insti
 ncts that arise from within.\n\nTogether we'll create a space where the wi
 ld\, authentic\, and fully alive parts of ourselves can emerge and dance.\
 n\n## About Guest DJ Stacey Butcher\n\nStacey Butcher is an Open Floor mov
 ement teacher\, serving on the faculty of Open Floor International\, and a
  Certified 5Rhythms teacher (trained by Gabrielle Roth). She is also a Som
 atic Experiencing Practitioner (SEP)\, Integral Somatic Psychology practit
 ioner\, and a Reiki Master/Teacher. Stacey has been dedicated to the heali
 ng arts for over 25 years and has studied with healers and teachers from a
 round the world. Her teaching is infused with passion\, deep presence and 
 humor. She is an inspirational facilitator and is skilled at holding space
  for transformation. For more info\, visit her website at h[ttp://www.stac
 eybutcher.com/]().\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance start
 s at Warm up. The doors close promptly at Opening Circle and any that come
  late will be turned away. Please be on time to ensure a safe and secure c
 ontainer. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $15 - $30 or name your price.\n\nNo one t
 urned away for lack of funds!\nPre-registration Recommended:\n\nVOLUNTEER!
 \n\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer and dance for free! Register to voluntee
 r at:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/](https://ashevi
 llemovementcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZW
 Q0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAE
 Tf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n
 \nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\nDoor will close at the beginning of the open
 ing circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nColl
 ective agreements:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/](h
 ttps://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTA
 AYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XG
 dFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1po
 otRUE4YAfA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement Collective envisions a world
  that moves in harmony where all are free to be their authentic selves wit
 hin a loving community. Our mission and aim are to inspire authenticity an
 d healthy community through free-form dance by hosting dance waves for per
 sonal and community transformation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organizat
 ion.\n\nLocation: 50 Bell Rd\, Asheville\, NC 28805\n\nSee you on the danc
 e floor!
