SUMMARY:Grounding into Peace - Ecstatic Dance Waves w/ DJ Kristikka
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, August 2nd\n\n1st Danc
 e Wave 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Dance 
 Wave 10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nDJ Kristi
 kka\n\n**Intention: Grounding into Peace**\n\nSo many spiritual teachers h
 ave spoken about peace and that it is an inside job. If we want more peace
  in the world\, we need to cultivate that and ground it deeper within ours
 elves. The intention of this dance is to surrender and dissolve anything t
 hat creates disharmony within us. Let’s generate a felt sense of peace t
 hat we can send into the Earth and the ether.\n\n## About DJ Kristikka\n\n
 Kristikka (Kris Hostikka) loves creating a sacred container that takes you
  on an inward journey utilizing rhythm to move us from quiet embodiment to
  chaos and down into stillness and integration. She feels that movement is
  medicine\, weaving intention and a rich blend of world beats where it’s
  possible to be with what is and open to what wants to be seen\, felt and 
 moved. You can find her dance mixes here:[ ](http://soundcloud.com/dj-kris
 tikka) [http://soundcloud.com/dj-kristikka](http://soundcloud.com/dj-krist
 ikka)\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance starts at Warm up.
  The doors close promptly at Opening Circle and people who arrive late wil
 l be turned away. Please be on time to ensure a safe and secure container.
  \\*\\*\n\nTicket Price: $15-30 or name your price.\nNo one turned away fo
 r lack of funds!\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\nPre-registration Recommended:\nFirst Wave
 : [https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/uqbb](https://ashevillemovement
 collective.org/uqbb)\nSecond Wave: [https://ashevillemovementcollective.or
 g/6r3x](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/6r3x)\n\nVOLUNTEER!\nWe ne
 ed volunteers. Volunteer and dance for free! Register to volunteer at: [ht
 tps://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/](https://ashevillemovemen
 tcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExVTF6aExURExqbn
 dxM3JFUHNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR6puHJaet_dJGFESCItA4rMD5vM
 _RHt9QzUSALulddRTAtGKexRuWuiBE8tDw_aem_vXP_JSWUu1NrAFuKa--PQA)\n\nIMPORTAN
 T ANNOUNCEMENTS:\nDoor will close at the beginning of the opening circle. 
 Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agree
 ments:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/](https://ashev
 illemovementcollective.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExVTF
 6aExURExqbndxM3JFUHNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR5CSyB7238bGlkEs
 U_Cg_jsh0446YHLe69W1y3KV5-T6oMaN-7Z3q32wDznUA_aem_wUhim1G2JnrnWxIQYKCcIA)\
 n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement Collective envisions a world that moves 
 in harmony where all are free to be their authentic selves within a loving
  community. Our mission and aim are to inspire authenticity and healthy co
 mmunity through free-form dance by hosting dance waves for personal and co
 mmunity transformation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\nSee 
 you on the dance floor!
