SUMMARY:Ancestor's Dream - Ecstatic Dance Wave w/ Facilitator Rory Jagdeo
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nFriday\, August 7th\nEvening Da
 nce Wave 7:00 pm \\- 9:00 pm \\| Warmup 7pm \\| Opening Circle 7:30pm\nFac
 ilitator Rory Jagdeo\n\nIntention: Ancestor's Dream\n\nAncestor’s Dream 
 \\~ Anonymous\n\nBeneath the soil of forgotten years\,\nThey spun their ho
 pe from grief and tears\,\nA whispered wish upon the night\,\nFor roots to
  hold and wings for flight.\n\nThey saw through mists of time and space\,\
 nThe bold emergence of our face\,\nAnd in the quiet of the dark\,\nThey ke
 pt alive the glowing spark.\n\nWe are the breath of what they sought\,\nTh
 e very peace for which they fought\,\nAcross the bridge of time\, we gleam
 :\nWe are our ancestor's great dream.\n\n## About Facilitator Rory Jagdeo\
 n\nRory is a singer/songwriter and an AMC Facilitator. He stepped into Ecs
 tatic Dance in Houston\, TX for the first time in 2014 and believes in the
  power of dance to transform and bring a healthier\, happier\, and connect
 ed lifestyle. It is that driving force and passion that pushes him to expl
 ore the role of being an Ecstatic Dance Facilitator using world rhythms an
 d different musical genres to weave mixes that incorporate many elements o
 f 8Rhythms.\n\nListen to his mixes at: [https://soundcloud.com/roryjagdeo]
 (https://soundcloud.com/roryjagdeo)\nAnd his music at: [https://roryjagdeo
 .bandcamp.com/releases](https://roryjagdeo.bandcamp.com/releases)\n\n\\~\\
 ~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance starts at Warm up. The doors clo
 se promptly at Opening Circle and any that come late will be turned away. 
 Please be on time to ensure a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Pr
 ices: $15 - $30 or name your price.\n\nNo one turned away for lack of fund
 s!\nPre-registration Recommended:\n\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need volunteers. Vol
 unteer and dance for free! Register to volunteer at:\n[https://ashevillemo
 vementcollective.org/volunteer/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/v
 olunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXB
 wX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr
 2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\
 n\nDoor will close at the beginning of the opening circle. Please note: NO
  ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\n[https:
 //ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/](https://ashevillemovementcol
 lective.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YU
 N0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbN
 b_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nAbout AMC:\n
 Asheville Movement Collective envisions a world that moves in harmony wher
 e all are free to be their authentic selves within a loving community. Our
  mission and aim are to inspire authenticity and healthy community through
  free-form dance by hosting dance waves for personal and community transfo
 rmation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\nLocation: 50 Bell R
 d\, Asheville\, NC 28805\n\nSee you on the dance floor!
