SUMMARY:Ecstatic Dance Wave w/ DJ SeigeA
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nFriday\, August 21st\nEvening D
 ance Wave 7:00 pm \\- 9:00 pm \\| Warmup 7pm \\| Opening Circle 7:30pm\nFa
 cilitator CJ O'Reilly \\| DJ SeigeA\n\nIntention: TBA\n\n## About Facilita
 tor DJ SeigeA\n\nCJ O'Reilly has been creating ecstatic dance waves for th
 e Asheville community since 2014. Their eclectic mix of musical styles bec
 kons dancers into new patterns of movement and expression through diverse 
 time signatures and instrumentation\, and a wide range of musical and emot
 ive qualities. CJ's waves explore high peaks\, beautiful vistas\, juicy lo
 wlands and the profound reflective stillness of tranquil water. CJ's dance
  waves are pre-produced and refined through the body and ears of a dancer 
 and audiophile.\nFind more of DJ SeigeA's dance waves at [https://dj.seige
 a.com](https://dj.seigea.com)\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the 
 dance starts at Warm up. The doors close promptly at Opening Circle and an
 y that come late will be turned away. Please be on time to ensure a safe a
 nd secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $15 - $30 or name your price.\
 n\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\nPre-registration Recommended:\n\
 nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer and dance for free! Register 
 to volunteer at:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/](htt
