SUMMARY:Welcome Home - Ecstatic Dance @WWC w/DJ Bobcat
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSaturday\, August 22nd\n\nStude
 nt Orientation Week\nw/ DJ Bobcat (Bob Swoap)\n\nIntention: Welcome Home\n
 Please park in the areas designated by the pins on [this map](https://www.
 google.com/maps/d/u/0/viewer?mid=1klDVoZpTMeSX6C0--t1XUFJRnRD9fe8&ll=35.61
 2205476786585%2C-82.44113015000002&z=17).\nThere are close locations for t
 hose with mobility challenges.\n\nWhether you've lived here for years or a
 rrived this week\, tonight is an invitation to feel at home -- in your bod
 y\, in movement\, and among people who love to dance.\nAs part of Warren W
 ilson College's Student Orientation\, this dance welcomes new students whi
 le inviting the greater Asheville dance community to share in the experien
 ce. Together\, we'll create a space where everyone -- new and returning\, 
 student and local -- can connect through movement.\n\nThis collaborative d
 ance between AMC and Warren Wilson College's Wilson Ecstatic Dance Student
  Activities group is a part of Student Orientation Week.\n\nThanks to the 
 collaboration with Warren Wilson College’s Wilson Ecstatic Dance Student
  Activities group\, all Warren Wilson Students & Faculty are invited to at
 tend this special event for free. Contributions are still welcomed. Studen
 ts and faculty please be sure to check the WWC checkbox when signing in. L
 et your friends know!\n\nPlease contribute up the sliding scale to support
  AMC!\n\nAbout the DJ\nDJ Bobcat\, Bob Swoap crafts journeys that invite d
 ancers to deeply connect: with themselves\, others\, nature\, and the musi
 c. He layers genres and world rhythms into an emotionally engaging set. At
  Warren Wilson College -- where he is professor of psychology and expressi
 ve arts therapy -- Bob facilitates ecstatic dance as a part of the communi
 ty wellness program\, bringing a grounded\, experienced presence to the fl
 oor. Favorite place to dance: outside at the WWC Pavilion. IG: @bob.swoap\
 n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance starts at Warm up. The d
 oors close promptly at Opening Circle and people who arrive late will be t
 urned away. Please be on time to ensure a safe and secure container. \\*\\
 *\n\nTicket Price: $20-40 or name your price.\nNo one turned away for lack
  of funds!\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\nPre-registration Recommended:\nhttps://ashevill
 emovementcollective.org/event/\n\nVOLUNTEER!\nWe need volunteers. Voluntee
 r and dance for free! Register to volunteer at: [https://ashevillemovement
 collective.org/volunteer/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunte
 er/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExVTF6aExURExqbndxM3JFUHNydGMGYXBwX2lkE
 DIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR6puHJaet_dJGFESCItA4rMD5vM_RHt9QzUSALulddRTAtGKex
 RuWuiBE8tDw_aem_vXP_JSWUu1NrAFuKa--PQA)\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\nDoor 
 will close at the beginning of the opening circle. Please note: NO ENTRY A
 FTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\n[https://ashevi
 llemovementcollective.org/our-dance/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.
 org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExVTF6aExURExqbndxM3JFUHNydG
 MGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR5CSyB7238bGlkEsU_Cg_jsh0446YHLe69W1y3K
 V5-T6oMaN-7Z3q32wDznUA_aem_wUhim1G2JnrnWxIQYKCcIA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAshevill
 e Movement Collective envisions a world that moves in harmony where all ar
 e free to be their authentic selves within a loving community. Our mission
  and aim are to inspire authenticity and healthy community through free-fo
 rm dance by hosting dance waves for personal and community transformation.
  AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\nSee you on the dance floor!
