 er journey and invitations that create a shift. While he likes modern elec
 tronic music\, he can’t create a mix without including lots of natural i
 nstruments and voices. Due to a short attention span\, he mixes in lots of
  different musical genres. You can hear some of his mixes on [https://www.
 mixcloud.com/tarisk/](https://www.mixcloud.com/tarisk/)\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\
 *\\* Please note that the dance starts at Warm up. The doors close promptl
 y at Opening Circle and any that come late will be turned away. Please be 
 on time to ensure a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $15 
 - $30 or name your price.\n\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\nPre-re
